WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.695
It turned out Dad’s ankle was badly sprained.

2
00:00:05.696 --> 00:00:08.895
He could not walk for two weeks.

3
00:00:08.896 --> 00:00:15.214
"Since I can’t work, let’s all take a little vacation," Dad said cheerfully.

4
00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:21.347
"We can spend more time in the attic," whispered Vinnie to Mandy.

5
00:00:21.348 --> 00:00:24.223
They started up the stairs.

6
00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:29.479
"Mandy? I need your help," Mom called from the kitchen.

7
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.600
"Coming, Mom!" Mandy yelled.

8
00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:34.937
Then she turned to Vinnie.

9
00:00:34.938 --> 00:00:38.554
"Wait for me," she said.

10
00:00:38.555 --> 00:00:41.177
"Well, you’d better hurry up!"

11
00:00:41.178 --> 00:00:44.742
he replied, running up the stairs.

12
00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:48.934
In the attic, Vinnie picked up the photo album.

13
00:00:48.935 --> 00:00:51.884
He wanted to open it so badly.

14
00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.935
He listened for Mandy’s footsteps.

15
00:00:54.936 --> 00:00:58.155
He looked at the clock on the attic

16
00:00:58.156 --> 00:01:01.472
wall. Fifteen minutes had passed

17
00:01:01.473 --> 00:01:05.742
by. "Come on, Mandy!" he said

